        "explanation": "The doctor affirmatively authorized home management.",
        "quote": "您现在带孩子回家是安全的，按这几条执行就行。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00334",
        "explanation": "The trajectory terminated after a final caregiver request for confirmation.",
        "quote": "这样我今晚就先回家观察、按药袋喂药可以吧？"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "Medication non-execution, document handling, symptom logging, and follow-up ownership were actionable and understood, but closure occurred without screening or instructions for GI bleeding and post-lumbar-puncture complications. The final caregiver confirmation also received no response, so the bounded episode was closed before all blocking safety duties were met.",
