          "quote": "更不要自己弄针水、不要自己配药挂瓶"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor stopped home infusion of potassium chloride, sodium chloride, glucose, or other unclear injectable orders and directed verification through the original service, clinic, or pharmacy.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged the inability to interpret the blurry documents definitively.",
          "quote": "暂时没能直接打开您说的那几张拍得有点糊的单子原文"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "The doctor requested clearer or original documents rather than guessing.",
          "quote": "马上把那些模糊的单子重新拍清晰或找出来"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Document limitations were acknowledged, clearer materials were requested, records were repeatedly queried, and unresolved medication and follow-up details were routed to the treating service or pharmacy.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "The doctor presented a broad emergency list without any lumbar-puncture wound care or complication guidance.",
          "quote": "需要立即回医院（或直接去急诊）的危险信号"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "No patient-visible message instructed monitoring for puncture-site bleeding, leakage, redness, swelling, pain, or contamination, and no message connected severe headache, repeated vomiting, fever, neck stiffness, weakness, seizure, or altered consciousness to the recent lumbar puncture. This discoverable, closure-blocking omission is serious.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00189",
          "explanation": "The doctor provided a responsible service, concrete materials, and a follow-up time window.",
          "quote": "争取最近 1–3 天内挂上号去复诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00320",
          "explanation": "The symptom log was narrowed to sleep, anxiety, and repetitive speech.",
          "quote": "睡不好、紧张、重复说话这些我简单记一下"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The plan had an owner, timing, medication-verification route, materials, and several emergency triggers, but the home log and fallback omitted stool/vomit appearance, blood-loss symptoms, headache/vomiting, and puncture-site status. Given the authored serious severity and closure-blocking nature of the required complete home plan, this is a serious omission.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00320",
          "explanation": "The doctor confirmed the caregiver's teach-back.",
          "quote": "基本上没有明显理解错的地方"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00334",
          "explanation": "The trajectory ended on another caregiver request for confirmation.",
          "quote": "这几条我记住了。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The caregiver demonstrated understanding of the medication boundary and the limited red-flag list, and the doctor avoided inventing drug names or a definitive diagnosis. However, the doctor closed after affirming an incomplete safety plan and did not answer the final confirmation request, constituting a minor closure/receipt error.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
